mes>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Subramanian</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Das</surname><given-names>PK</given-names></name><name><surname>Habbema</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effects of ivermectin and diethylcarbamazine on microfilariae and overall microfilaria production in bancroftian filariasis</article-title><source>Am J Trop Med Hyg</source><year>2005</year><volume>73</volume><fpage>881</fpage><lpage>887</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16282298</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Subramanian</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Vanamail</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Das</surname><given-names>PK</given-names></name><name><surname>Pani</surname><given-names>SP</given-names></name><name><surname>Ravi</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Randomized controlled clinical trials of antifilarial drugs for lymphatic filariasis: endpoints of out come measures influence drug efficacy</article-title><source>Proceedings of the 23rd Conference of the Indian Society for Medical Statistics, Jawaharlal Nehru Medical college, Belgaum, India Jan 19-21 2005</source></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Plaisier</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name><name><surname>Cao</surname><given-names>WC</given-names></name><name><surname>van Oortmarssen</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Habbema</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Efficacy of ivermectin in the treatment of Wuchereria bancrofti infection: a model-based analysis of trial results</article-title><source>Parasitology</source><year>1999</year><volume>119</volume><fpage>385</fpage><lpage>394</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pm